<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    🔴 WITHOUT THIS FILE THE MOD DOES NOTHING, AND NOTHING SAYS SO.

    Defining a WorldGenStepDef is NOT enough to make it run. Verified two ways:

      1. In the compiled code, PlanetLayerDef.GenStepsInOrder is
             worldGenSteps.Where(...).OrderBy(...)
         over the layer def's own PRIVATE List<WorldGenStepDef> worldGenSteps —
         NOT over DefDatabase<WorldGenStepDef>.AllDefs.

      2. On disk, Data/Core/Defs/PlanetLayerDefs/PlanetLayers.xml lines 14-26
         list the Surface layer's steps BY DEFNAME: Terrain, Lakes, Rivers,
         Mutators, Landmarks, AncientSites, AncientRoads, Pollution, Factions,
         Roads, Features.

    A step that is not in that list is loaded, is valid, is visible in the def
    database, and is never called. There is no error and no warning — worldgen
    simply produces an unshaped planet, which looks exactly like a step that ran
    and did nothing. This is the most expensive class of failure this project
    keeps meeting: a silent no-op that costs a full world generation to notice.

    ⚠️ POSITION IN THE LIST DOES NOT SET THE ORDER. GenStepsInOrder sorts by the
    WorldGenStepDef's own <order> field, so appending at the end is correct and
    our order 20 still places us after Tiles (5) and before Lakes (150).
    Do not "fix" this by trying to insert the <li> at a particular position.

    ⚠️ The list is cached in PlanetLayerDef.cachedGenSteps on first read, so this
    has to be a load-time patch. It cannot be done at runtime.

    Conditional so that a future vanilla change which already includes us, or a
    layer def that has been restructured, degrades to a no-op instead of an error.
  -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PlanetLayerDef[defName="Surface"]/worldGenSteps</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationConditional">
      <xpath>/Defs/PlanetLayerDef[defName="Surface"]/worldGenSteps/li[text()="Jawa_SeaShaping"]</xpath>
      <nomatch Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>/Defs/PlanetLayerDef[defName="Surface"]/worldGenSteps</xpath>
        <value>
          <li>Jawa_SeaShaping</li>
        </value>
      </nomatch>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
